      "surroundingText": "A journey starts with a conversationWhere would youlike to go next?A place you’ve always imagined. A wildlife encounter you’ve waited for. Tell us what draws you there, and we’ll help shape the journey.Private journeys, bespoke safaris and photography tours across India and beyond.Every journey begins with a little curiosity.Prefer to write directly?info@safaricrafters.com ↗Planning for your company, partners or clients? Explore corporate journeys ↗Your travel briefLet’s make a beginning.Start with what you know. We’ll work out the details together.Name, email, phone number and a short message are required.Your details help us respond to your enquiry. Privacy policy",
